"about": {"track":"Tuzla, Turčija (id tuzla): the 5.3 km circuit on the Asian side of Istanbul, counter-clockwise, with a long four-apex left bend, one lap (docs/nove-proge-1-0.md)","frame":"metres; origin = the start line (lat0, lon0: the first point of the route); x east, z south; x = (lon - lon0) * N cos(lat0), z = -(lat - lat0) * M (WGS84 radii at lat0)","line":"the centre line every 5.002 m from the start line round the lap (closed; the last point joins the first): OSM's polyline every 1 m, a Gaussian of sigma 3 m (the corners rounded), resampled","h":"the road's height at each point of line (m above sea level, 0.1 m): the ground model across the road (median of 5 samples, -8..8 m), the bridges straight from bank to bank, dips under 60 m filled, a 35 m median, sigma 15 m, grades at most 12 %, sigma 5 m","hRaw":"the ground model under each point of line before the smoothing (m, 0.1 m)","ways":"[s0, s1, road name (geographic names only), OSM highway, lanes, width, oneway today, surface, maxspeed, bridge]: the route's OSM ways in driving order (s in m from the start line)","bends":"[s of the apex, radius m, side (1 right, -1 left), turn deg]: the bends of line with a radius under 60 m","bld":"[x, z, length, width, angle (rad, the long side from +x towards +z), height (m, 0 = not in OSM), kind, s, d (m, + right of the travel direction)]: the buildings with any part within 60 m (OSM); kinds: 0 house / unknown, 1 church / chapel, 2 tower, 3 castle, 4 shed / garage / kiosk, 5 commercial / hotel / industrial, 6 public / station / school, 7 greenhouse, 8 ruin, 9 block of flats","bldOutline":"[index in bld, [x, z, ...]]: the outline of the buildings that are not a rectangle","trees":"[x, z, kind]: single trees (OSM) within 60 m; kind p pine, c cypress, o olive, m palm, b broadleaved, '' unknown","treeRows":"[kind, [x, z, ...]]","walls":"[barrier (OSM: wall, retaining_wall, fence, guard_rail, hedge ...), height (0 = untagged), wall / material, [x, z, ...]]: within 30 m","